23:Roadmap row `W26` carries the build of two operator rulings: //the system wikis release; every other wiki reads the floor// (2026-10-16) and //one owner per registry; the floor reads by CID// (2026-10-18), both at <<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road">> #/rulings. Rows `W21` and `P8` ride it. The law it enacts already stands at <<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/wiki-layer-ontology">> #/oracle-planes: an oracle names documents at one scope, that scope's owner writes its registry, and a registry travels no wider than its scope.
